{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/32149","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:38.344833+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"### Description\n\nIt seems that a jitted function can tolerate input tensors that are sharded on a different mesh from the context mesh, but this tolerance is lost when buffer_callback is used, even if the tensor is already resharded onto the context mesh before being passed into the buffer callback.\n\nFor example, the following jitted function works when no buffer_callback is used:\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.lax import with_sharding_constraint\nfrom jax.sharding import NamedSharding, PartitionSpec\nfrom jax.experimental import buffer_callback\n\n@jax.jit\ndef f(x):\n  x = with_sharding_constraint(x, PartitionSpec('x', 'y')) \n  return x + 1\n\nmesh1 = jax.make_mesh((2, 4), ('a', 'b'))\nmesh2 = jax.make_mesh((4, 2), ('x', 'y'))\n\nX = jax.device_put(jnp.ones((32, 32)), NamedSharding(mesh1, PartitionSpec('a', 'b')))\n\nwith mesh2:\n  Y = f(X)\n  print(Y)\n\n<OUTPUT>:\n[[2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]\n [2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]\n [2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]\n ...\n [2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]\n [2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]\n [2. 2. 2. ... 2. 2. 2.]]\n```\n\nwhile adding a no-op buffer callback errors out:\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.lax import with_sharding_constraint\nfrom jax.sharding import NamedSharding, PartitionSpec\nfrom jax.experimental import buffer_callback\n\ndef no_op(ctx, output, inputs):\n  pass\n\n@jax.jit\ndef f(x):\n  x = with_sharding_constraint(x, PartitionSpec('x', 'y'))\n  output_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(x.shape, x.dtype)\n  buffer_call = buffer_callback.buffer_callback(no_op, output_shape, command_buffer_compatible=True)\n  return buffer_call((x,))\n\nmesh1 = jax.make_mesh((2, 4), ('a', 'b'))\nmesh2 = jax.make_mesh((4, 2), ('x', 'y'))\n\nX = jax.device_put(jnp.ones((32, 32)), NamedSharding(mesh1, PartitionSpec('a', 'b')))\n\nwith mesh2:\n  Y = f(X)\n  print(Y)\n\n<OUTPUT>\nFile /opt/jax/jax/_src/interpreters/pxla.py:2382, in lower_sharding_computation(closed_jaxpr, api_name, fun_name, in_shardings, out_shardings, in_layouts, out_layouts, donated_invars, keep_unused, context_mesh, compiler_options_kvs, lowering_platforms, lowering_parameters, pgle_profiler)\n   2379     if isinstance(sharding, NamedSharding):\n   2380       if (abstract_mesh is not None and\n   2381           abstract_mesh != sharding.mesh.abstract_mesh):\n-> 2382         raise ValueError(\n   2383             \"mesh should be the same across the entire program. Got mesh\"\n   2384             f\" shape for one sharding {abstract_mesh} and\"\n   2385             f\" {sharding.mesh.abstract_mesh} for another\")\n   2386       abstract_mesh = sharding.mesh.abstract_mesh\n   2388 semantic_in_shardings = SemanticallyEqualShardings(\n   2389     in_shardings, global_in_avals)\n\nValueError: mesh should be the same across the entire program. Got mesh shape for one sharding AbstractMesh('a': 2, 'b': 4, axis_types=(Auto, Auto), device_kind=NVIDIA H200, num_cores=132) and AbstractMesh('x': 4, 'y': 2, axis_types=(Auto, Auto), device_kind=NVIDIA H200, num_cores=132) for another\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.7.2.dev20250821+2023afd2d\njaxlib: 0.7.2.dev20250927\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.12.3 (main, Jun 18 2025, 17:59:45) [GCC 13.3.0]\ndevice info: NVIDIA H200-8, 8 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='viking-prod-283', release='5.15.0-1065-nvidia', version='#66-Ubuntu SMP Fri Aug 30 13:56:20 UTC 2024', machine='x86_64')\nJAX_TOOLBOX_REF=58cfa4b3fed552c7289e56c420623ac18420a676\nXLA_FLAGS= --xla_gpu_enable_latency_hiding_scheduler=true\n\n$ nvidia-smi\nSat Sep 27 05:51:26 2025       \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 550.90.07              Driver Version: 550.90.07      CUDA Version: 12.9     |\n|-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA H200                    On  |   00000000:1B:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   36C    P0            116W /  500W |  110068MiB / 143771MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   1  NVIDIA H200                    On  |   00000000:43:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   39C    P0            115W /  700W |  110428MiB / 143771MiB |      0%      Default |\n...\n|    6   N/A  N/A    185708      C   /usr/bin/python3                                0MiB |\n|    7   N/A  N/A    185708      C   /usr/bin/python3                                0MiB |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","closed_at":"2025-09-29T23:05:23Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_ur